            <note corresp="#d507-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d507-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 684A.85/7–2656. Confidential; Niact. Drafted by Bergus and Burdett;
                    cleared by Murphy, Wilcox, and Allen; and approved by Burdett who signed for Hoover. Repeated priority to USUN, Amman, and London; pouched to Paris, Moscow, and
                    Jerusalem.</p>
